From 5ddc36a91da81d0b8f4fa17fbf8b708bf1c7d1f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 13:18:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] wayland: Implement ext-background-effect-v1

Expose ext-background-effect-v1 with the blur capability and attach one
background-effect resource to each wl_surface.

The blur region follows the protocol's double-buffered state model. Regions
are copied from wl_region resources, can be cleared with NULL, and are
clipped to the surface bounds when actor state is synchronized.

Part-of: <https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/merge_requests/5071>
